From: vyos-ls1046a-build CI <ci@local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fman: PCD KeyGen/CC/HM/policer subsystem install

Consolidates 0097 (fman-pcd-keygen) + 0098 (fman-pcd-cc-static-install) +
0099 (fman-pcd-hm-install) + 0100 (fman-pcd-plcr-install) into one patch:
four sequential install-registration steps from this file's own
"0092-0100: PCD subsystem, KeyGen, CC, HM, policer" section, all with the
same small footprint (Makefile object-list entry, dpaa_fman_caps.c
capability wiring, fman_pcd.h prototype), same-day authorship (0098/0099
both dated 2026-05-29), applied in strict sequence with nothing else
interleaved.

Verified against the real CI checkpoint commits in the persistent
kernel-git-cache (run 34562697395, checkpoints e08fb896625b "applied:
0096..." to 86e3a1da75d3 "applied: 0100..."), round-trip verified
byte-identical via `patch -p1`.

Touches: dpaa_fman_caps.c, fman/Makefile, fman_keygen.c, fman_pcd.h.

Signed-off-by: vyos-ls1046a-build CI <ci@local>
---
